 "answer": "[1] 关键金融指标：  \n资产负债率（Debt to Asset Ratio）\n\n[2] 可能的计算公式：  \n资产负债率 = 总负债 / 总资产 × 100%\n['资产负债率', 'Debt to Asset Ratio', '总负债', '总资产']\n此问题不涉及到个股、行业或者题材\n个股相关\n['主板基本信息', '主板财务']\n['ANA_STK_QTR_IDX', 'VIEW_STK_BALA_GEN', 'VIEW_STK_FIN_IDX', 'VIEW_STK_FIN_IDX_PLUS', 'STK_COMSUB_PROFILE', 'GET_A_INDUSTRY', 'GET_A_SEC_CODE']\n是否命中召回表：False\n生成查询代码\nSELECT \n    ga.SEC_SNAME AS `股票名称`,\n    ga.SEC_CODE AS `股票代码`,\n    vsp.ENDDATE AS `截止日期`,\n    ROUND(vsp.TA_TLIA, 2) AS `资产负债率(%)`\nFROM \n    VIEW_STK_FIN_IDX_PLUS vsp\nINNER JOIN \n    GET_A_SEC_CODE ga\n    ON vsp.COMCODE = ga.COMCODE\nWHERE \n    vsp.RPT_TYPE = '2'\n    AND vsp.RPT_TAG = 7\n    AND vsp.ENDDATE = '2025-12-31 00:00:00'\n    AND vsp.TA_TLIA IS NOT NULL\n    AND ga.ISVALID = 1\nORDER BY \n    vsp.TA_TLIA DESC\n200\n{table:[['股票名称', '截止日期', '资产负债率(%)'], ['*ST皇庭', '2025-12-31', '228.11'], ['*ST赛为', '2025-12-31', '219.44'], ['*ST湘邮', '2025-12-31', '201.05'], ['*ST泉为', '2025-12-31', '151.11'], ['*ST棒杰', '2025-12-31', '143.45'], ['*ST开元', '2025-12-31', '127.70'], ['*ST康佳A', '2025-12-31', '126.22'], ['ST合纵', '2025-12-31', '120.95'], ['*ST金灵', '2025-12-31', '119.65'], ['*ST中迪', '2025-12-31', '115.50'], ['*ST易录', '2025-12-31', '113.16'], ['*ST华鹏', '2025-12-31', '112.27'], ['*ST发展', '2025-12-31', '112.23'], ['*ST岭南', '2025-12-31', '111.67'], ['ST华扬', '2025-12-31', '110.59'], ['*ST英飞', '2025-12-31', '108.19'], ['*ST春兴', '2025-12-31', '108.17'], ['*ST纳川', '2025-12-31', '107.07'], ['*ST八钢', '2025-12-31', '106.18'], ['*ST仕净', '2025-12-31', '105.49'], ['*ST顾地', '2025-12-31', '105.37'], ['*ST西旅', '2025-12-31', '104.62'], ['石药景峰', '2025-12-31', '103.45'], ['*ST中岩', '2025-12-31', '102.73'], ['*ST宝馨', '2025-12-31', '102.58'], ['*ST康乐', '2025-12-31', '102.18'], ['*ST亿晶', '2025-12-31', '102.02'], ['*ST华幸', '2025-12-31', '101.89'], ['*ST亚士', '2025-12-31', '101.62'], ['*ST美芝', '2025-12-31', '100.65'], ['中创环保', '2025-12-31', '100.61'], ['*ST广糖', '2025-12-31', '99.76'], ['*ST启环', '2025-12-31', '99.46'], ['科恒股份', '2025